@using CafeChain.Application.Interfaces
@using CafeChain.Application.Constants
@inject ICartService CartService
@{
    // Lấy tổng số lượng từ Session ngay khi load trang
    int cartCount = CartService.GetTotalCount();
    string currentController = ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() ?? "Home";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - CafeChain</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Styles", required: false)
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">
    <header class="bg-white sticky-top">
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg py-3">
            <div class="container">
                <a class="navbar-brand text-orange fw-bold fs-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                    <i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill"></i> CafeChain
                </a>

                <button class="navbar-toggler border-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarMain">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>

                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarMain">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto ms-4 mb-2 mb-lg-0 fw-semibold">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link px-3 @(currentController == "Home" ? "text-dark fw-bold" : "text-muted")" asp-area="" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Trang chủ</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link px-3 @(currentController == "Drink" ? "text-dark fw-bold" : "text-muted")" asp-area="" asp-controller="Drink" asp-action="Menu">Thực đơn</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-4">
                        <form asp-controller="Drink" asp-action="Menu" method="get" class="search-box position-relative d-none d-md-block" style="width: 250px;">
                            <i class="bi bi-search position-absolute top-50 start-0 translate-middle-y ms-3 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;"></i>
                            <input type="text" name="keyword" class="form-control rounded-pill ps-5 border-0" placeholder="Tìm cà phê..." value="@(ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "Drink" ? Context.Request.Query["keyword"] : "")">
                        </form>

                        <a asp-controller="Cart" asp-action="Index" class="position-relative text-orange text-decoration-none">
                            <i class="bi bi-cart2 fs-4"></i>

                            <span id="cart-badge" class="position-absolute top-0 start-100 translate-middle badge rounded-pill bg-danger border border-light @(cartCount > 0 ? "" : "d-none")" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">
                                @cartCount
                                <span class="visually-hidden">sản phẩm trong giỏ</span>
                            </span>
                        </a>

                        @if (User.Identity != null && User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
                        {
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center ms-3">
                                @if (User.IsInRole(RoleConstants.Customer))
                                {
                                    <a href="/Customer/Profile" class="d-flex align-items-center text-decoration-none bg-light rounded-pill px-2 py-1 shadow-sm border">
                                        <img id="headerAvatar"
                                             src="@(User.FindFirst("AvatarUrl")?.Value ?? "/Images/Upload/avtdf.jpg")"
                                             onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/Images/Upload/avtdf.jpg';"
                                             class="rounded-circle object-fit-cover me-2"
                                             style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 1px solid #d35400;"
                                             alt="Avatar">
                                        <span class="text-dark fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">@User.Identity.Name</span>
                                    </a>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <span class="d-flex align-items-center text-decoration-none bg-light rounded-pill px-2 py-1 shadow-sm border">
                                        <img id="headerAvatar"
                                             src="@(User.FindFirst("AvatarUrl")?.Value ?? "/Images/Upload/avtdf.jpg")"
                                             onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/Images/Upload/avtdf.jpg';"
                                             class="rounded-circle object-fit-cover me-2"
                                             style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 1px solid #d35400;"
                                             alt="Avatar">
                                        <span class="text-dark fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">@User.Identity.Name</span>
                                    </span>
                                }
                            </div>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <a class="btn btn-outline-orange rounded-pill px-4" style="background-color: #fff3ed; border: none; color: #d35400; font-weight: 600;" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">
                                Đăng nhập
                            </a>
                            <a class="btn btn-outline-orange rounded-pill px-4" style="background-color: #fff3ed; border: none; color: #d35400; font-weight: 600;" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register">
                                Đăng kí
                            </a>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container-fluid p-0 flex-grow-1">
        <main role="main">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>
    </div>
    <footer class="text-light mt-auto" style="background-color: var(--footer-bg); padding-top: 3rem;">
        <div class="container py-5">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                    <a class="navbar-brand text-orange fw-bold fs-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                        <i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill"></i> CafeChain
                    </a>
                    <p class="text-muted small">Hương vị cà phê nguyên bản từ những vùng nguyên liệu trứ danh, kết nối tâm hồn Việt.</p>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 mt-4">
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-facebook"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-instagram"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-light fs-5"><i class="bi bi-youtube"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-2 col-md-6 col-6">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">Về chúng tôi</h6>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled text-muted small">
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Tuyển dụng</a></li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Ưu đãi thành viên</a></li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Chính sách bảo mật</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-2 col-md-6 col-6">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">Hỗ trợ khách hàng</h6>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled text-muted small">
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Liên hệ</a></li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Q&A</a></li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Vận chuyển</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 small text-muted">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-light">Thông tin liên hệ</h6>
                    <p><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-2 text-orange"></i> 123 Đường Cà Phê, Quận 1, TP. HCM</p>
                    <p><i class="bi bi-telephone-fill me-2 text-orange"></i> 1900 xxxx</p>
                    <p><i class="bi bi-envelope-fill me-2 text-orange"></i> contact@cafechain.vn</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-secondary mt-5 mb-4">

            <div class="row small text-muted">
                <div class="col-md-6 text-center text-md-start">
                    &copy; 2026 CafeChain. Tất cả quyền được bảo lưu.
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 text-center text-md-end">
                    <a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted me-3">Điều khoản</a>
                    <a href="#" class="text-decoration-none text-muted">Chính sách</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>